Package: phonon-rs
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libasound2
Maintainer: apiplant <releases@apiplant.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/phonon-rs
Description: Phonon-2 speech-to-text CLI and dictation daemon (candle)
 phonon transcribes audio files or the microphone with Phonon-2, the
 five-value quantised Parakeet-TDT-0.6B-v3, natively on candle. phonon-
 dictate (Linux only) is a push-to-talk dictation daemon. The model is
 not bundled: pass --model or set PHONON_MODEL to the unpacked Phonon-2
 model directory or its .tar.zst.
